                            <div class="na-kart"><div class="na-kart-b"><span><i class="fas fa-route me-1"></i>Onay Akışı</span><span class="not">parametrik</span></div><div class="na-kart-g"><div class="mh-akis" id="mhAkis"><span class="text-muted">—</span></div><div class="na-mini" id="mhAkisNedeni"></div></div></div>
